{"parse": {"title": "LD-07", "pageid": 84461, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LD-06\" title=\"LD-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LD-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/LD-08\" title=\"LD-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A9.E5.8D.88.E9.A4.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"早午餐\">早午餐</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 早午餐</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Brunch</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>沟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>壑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>用<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>实<span class=\"color-value\"></span>物<span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>其<span class=\"color-value\"></span>填<span class=\"color-value\"></span>补<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>包<span class=\"color-value\"></span>括<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>个<span class=\"color-value\"></span>拥<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2310107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_at_lianxi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_at_lianxi\"><img alt=\"2_3_at_lianxi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-2_3_at_lianxi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_at_lianxi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-2_3_at_lianxi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_at_lianxi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-2_3_at_lianxi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_at_lianxi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>……自由祭祀是最受瞩目的乌卢鲁项目之一，因为它不仅是奇诡瑰丽的表演，还是数千名观众与舞者的情绪共鸣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>夏洛特……她就像是为此而生的天才，并且奇遇般地与那位浑身插满乌鸦羽毛、终日研读古代凯尔特部落符文的教练结识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-628613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-628613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-628613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>乌鸦教练将最原始的女巫之舞传授给夏洛特，从而彻底点燃了她内在的火焰——直到十年前的悲剧带走了她的右腿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>夏洛特得到了一袋花种作为练习的奖励，传说这些种子来自于格拉斯顿伯里森林中隐居的德鲁伊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-628601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>这片花园就是如此诞生的，奇异植物与花园的主人终日共享同一种呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_guzhai1\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_guzhai1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巨大多脉的叶片垂落于泥土中，牙仙记得第一次来到这座花园时，生命并未散发这样委顿的气息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门边的女人轻轻摇头，而纸信圈儿则直接蹲在了骇人的植物之下，将头伸进了茂密的植物丛中，找寻着奇形怪状的虫子的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>谢谢你们再次邀请我过来……关于夏洛特，我也只能说这么多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到了总结性的话语，纸信圈儿站了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>你说的那些地方，那片森林，那个德鲁伊，我也能去吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>德鲁伊不是地名，而是一种身份。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>身份……就像我是纸信圈儿一样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子又陷入了自己的思索中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>感谢你的坦诚与合作，卡洛琳女士，很抱歉占用了你的练习时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>嗯。我本来也不太喜欢和政府官员打交道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>成就斐然的自由祭祀运动员向来直言不讳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡洛琳再次瞥向维多利亚古宅紧闭的窄窗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>如果官方还在怀疑夏洛特就是召唤黑雾的女巫，那我现在就告诉你——她不是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>我以我作为乌卢鲁运动员的所有荣誉向你保证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>她和我一样，不是传统意义上的女巫。我们练习巫术是为了拿奖牌，而不是为了召唤魔鬼或者下毒诅咒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>这一点应该是足以取信的。如此一来，有关“雾中鬼婆”的调查事实上已经结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>……牙仙女士，如果你觉得应该为我的配合提供报酬，那么，请帮我个忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙点头，向来直率的女人却还在酝酿措辞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，她放弃了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>总之……做点什么，牙仙女士，她不能再这么邋遢下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>你打算做什么都行，砸烂她的门也好，把她拖出来也好，还是要把这栋房子直接掀翻，都随你的便。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>但就是别让她再躲在这破宅子里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>你进去吧，我能感觉到，花园现在没有力量阻拦任何人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……你很了解这片花园。在你上一次造访时，她有没有和你见面？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡洛琳咬着下唇，强忍着把抵到齿尖的话吞回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她头也不回地离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>……我觉得卡洛琳很想和我们一起进去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>可我们也拦不住她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙摇晃着手中的罐子——不是通常装满“牙仙”的那只，而是装满羊脂蜗牛的类似品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>来吧，我们还有事情要做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>好吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医生与女孩谨慎地踏入花园，疏松多孔的泥土在她足底被压实，没有什么再来阻拦她的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们顺从地绕过一些看起来不好招惹的植物，沿着蜿蜒曲折的道路来到镶嵌铁钉的橡木门前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙想要敲门，却没有料到沉重的大门轻轻一推就向后退去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>门没有上锁，进来吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_fangjian\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_fangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女巫坐在餐桌后，就着一盘茄汁焗豆吃苏格兰炸鸡蛋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只服务于一位食客的餐桌上，还能见到吃剩的烤苹果派、油炸鳕鱼和薯条的影子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>打扰了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房屋主人将最基本的礼仪都抛至九霄云外，根本不在乎提醒客人入座，自顾自地切下又一块烤香肠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>唔咕——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>突然吃下太多油腻和高含糖量的食物会让你得胃病的，夏洛特女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随即选择继续食用丰盛到近乎异常的早午餐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>我选择用“牙仙”来代替“坎贝尔”，并且早已习惯，但你是否接受这个其他人附加于你的称呼？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>还是，你更习惯夏洛特·奥黑根这个名字？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>一个……优秀的乌卢鲁运动员的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>餐具碰撞的声音再次中断，这次等了很长时间都没有再度响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她仰起头，双手扫过桌面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>镀银的餐盘丁零当啷地滚向地面，敲响一段毫无美感的聒噪音乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>你的眼神最好没出问题，医生。我的腿断了，是个残疾人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>夏洛特就是夏洛特，笃笃骨就是笃笃骨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>我和乌卢鲁没有关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>据我所知，乌卢鲁运动会并没有拒绝残疾人参赛的传统。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>如果你喜欢扮演马戏团里的小丑，那就去吧，但我没有这种癖好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>没有人会在赛场上丢脸，尤其是愿意挑战自我的人，这与乌卢鲁的精神不谋而合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女巫挣扎，站起，愤恨地用假肢锤击着地面，仿佛要借此将支撑她的右腿砸个粉碎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>我不记得什么时候请了一个烦人的家庭教师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>你比我更加年长，想必先我一步知晓了生活的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>出去，我从没有邀请过你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>我是为纸信圈儿来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听见纸信圈儿的名字，笃笃骨愣了愣神，向后退了一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>你想说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>我知道这里通常不欢迎除了纸信圈儿之外的客人，但我正是代替那孩子来向你道歉的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……道歉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将一小罐蜗牛置于桌面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>这是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>一份表示歉意的礼物，她已经准备多时了——天还没亮的时候，她就从我的看护下逃走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>她一直在帮你收集这些神秘学生物，好让你能制作用于义肢的润滑脂，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>可她害怕你再次生她的气，所以我决定先替她把礼物交给它应该归属的主人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>不要把我说得像一个恶棍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>你没做错什么，我也知道，你不是人们口中的那一类女巫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>就像我说的，要道歉的是纸信圈儿，错在她“不该伤了你的心”——这是原话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>卡洛琳小姐在她身边说了不少故事，在此之前，纸信圈儿从来不知道你是一位如此优秀又坚强的乌卢鲁运动员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>卡洛琳——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>装满蜗牛的罐子被轻轻推到距离笃笃骨更近的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>你能接受这份礼物吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨伸出手，指腹轻轻搭在罐体上。她没有推开罐子，也没有拿走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>多管闲事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>纸信圈儿在哪里？你的临时医院？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>你想去找她吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女巫的五官仿佛绞成一股绳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>该死的，别在这装腔作势！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨将蜗牛罐子朝自己的方向拉近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>——是我有错！我不该那么对一个孩子说话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>你在等的就是这个，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>现在你满意了，快带我去见她！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>她和我一起来的，已经在门口等候很久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……一起？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一颗小脑袋从门框边缘悄悄探出来。她瞪大了眼睛，好确认屋内的黑暗中不再有危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>笃笃骨？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>事已至此，退无可退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>进来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子的委屈总是不知道从何而来，现在她又想哭了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>别哭——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>听好了，我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>就是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……我不该用那种态度对你，不管是上一次，还是上上一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙轻悄悄地点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>好了，你不能哭了，别在我家——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>呵——呵嗯——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她义无反顾地朝餐桌飞奔而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨的双手打开又合上，像一只因受到惊吓而立起前肢的蜘蛛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不知道自己能否接得住这一只乱糟糟的破布团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>喂！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她接住了，但人也向后倒去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>对……对不起……是我错了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>啧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>我以后不会在你家捣乱了，你允许我什么时候来，我就什么时候来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>你让我说什么，我就说什么，你不让我说什么我就什么都不会说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她下意识地想要去看牙仙的表情，却发现后者正把全部的注意力放在墙上的乌卢鲁自由祭祀油画上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隔着不知多少层旧衣服，女巫轻轻拍了拍纸信圈儿的后脖颈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>我——我以后还能到你的花园来，还能到你家来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女巫捂住女孩的嘴，打断了她的哭诉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-310510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>唔——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>再哭下去我就要受不了了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-310515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-310515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-310515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>好，我……我不哭了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女巫轻轻一推，纸信圈儿就像一只被风吹起的布袋子那般飘了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可正当她庆幸失去了重压时，一个尴尬的问题向她袭来——她起不来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>我来……帮你？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸信圈儿挪到她的右手边，平齐地伸出两只手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……呵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨握住援手，完成了一次完美的站立，忽然吹来的风帮助她保持了平衡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>够了，闹到这种程度已经够我受了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>没有什么其他事的话，我恳请二位离开吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>你们还得去追查那道神秘的雾气，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>当然，我必须要说，这和我没有半点关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>夏洛特……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>就叫我笃笃骨吧，你还有什么想说的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>这次就让那些食物好好地呆在你的肚子里吧，偶尔多吃一点没关系的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨强行解开了纸信圈儿环在自己腰肢上的手臂，将不舍的女孩推得离自己远些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>知道了，快走吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙领着纸信圈儿退出了房间，古宅里又只剩了孤寂，敦实厚重的钟咔嚓咔嚓地走着，像是在拧什么东西的发条。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>让她看到过我太多的不堪了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LD-07"}}